{"g":5,"b":2,"k":"h","q":"Hvad betyder 'No way!'?","o":["Aldrig i livet!/Det er ikke rigtigt!","Ingen vej!","Ikke den vej!","Nej tak!"],"a":"Aldrig i livet!/Det er ikke rigtigt!","r":"'No way!' betyder 'aldrig i livet!' eller 'det tror jeg ikke på!'"},
{"g":5,"b":2,"k":"l","q":"Læs: 'Last Saturday Mark went to a football match with his uncle. Their team lost 2-1.' Hvordan gik kampen for deres hold?","o":["De vandt","Uafgjort","Kampen blev aflyst","De tabte"],"a":"De tabte","r":"'Lost' er datid af 'lose' = tabte."},
{"g":5,"b":2,"k":"l","q":"Læs: 'Ella didn't eat her lunch because she wasn't hungry. Later she was very hungry.' Hvornår var Ella sulten?","o":["ved frokost","om morgenen","senere","aldrig"],"a":"senere","r":"'Later' betyder senere."},
